    {
      "question": "e-548",
      "field": null,
      "attribute": "question/worked-solution",
      "old_sha256": "833be29f421f21d552d693d39481bfb05001388995692f52dfa6dcf283cb97cf",
      "new_sha256": "e0988c938d7d4d42059f10c420fd5e88c9eae12804b1ca1529e95153e307f5f3",
      "category": "ma_capture",
      "authoring": [],
      "source": [
        {
          "question": "e-548",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/worked-solution",
          "value": "Applying the average value formula, we find that the average value of the function is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{\\text{avg}} & =\\frac{1}{b-a}\\,{\\int }_{a}^{b}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4-(-2)}{\\int }_{-2}^{4}x-2\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}-2x){|}_{-2}^{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}[(\\frac{{4}^{2}}{2}-2(4))-(\\frac{(-2)^{2}}{2}-2(-2))] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}[(8-8)-(2+4)] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}(0-6) \\\\  & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
          "category": "ma_capture",
          "file": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013500/example-548.json",
          "file_sha256": "ea5755655871f1a8187caf2a4b73b29959c623f03dea5c558d1dfb3d9d6df9f5"
