        {
          "question": "e-550",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "The graph of the function $f(x),$ which is defined on $[1,6],$ is shown below. The areas of the regions between the graph and the $x$-axis are $5$ and $2,$ respectively (from left to right). Find the average value of $f(x)$ on $[1,6].$ \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013500/assets/6433d1ca57ceb334f304e894e2655ef50d987567fbcf219314302bb381fd9a83.png)",
